{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2812100/extras/welcome.bw.png?t=1753238108\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2812100/extras/LandscapeSwitch.750.gif?t=1753238108\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You are a Steward, here to take care of your very own Research Station in the mysterious lands of Nu Juno. Repair the stations crumbling facilities, tend to your garden and explore the vibrant and vast lands. Unearthed nature and relics of bygone expeditions are all out there for you to find.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2812100/extras/Survive_the_Seasons.png?t=1753238108\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2812100/extras/Timeline_1.gif?t=1753238108\" /></div>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2812100/extras/WavingCamp.gif?t=1753238108\" /></div> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Shepard your community through the seasons and storms of Nu Juno. Manage your station and its resources and build it into a home for you and your guests.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each biome has its own seasons and storms for you to overcome! Will you scale alpine mountains and brave the harsh cold, or dredge through the flooding swamps of the deep forest?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2812100/extras/make_friends.bw.png?t=1753238108\" /></div></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2812100/extras/Talking.gif?t=1753238108\" /></div>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2812100/extras/Creature.gif?t=1753238108\" /></div></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Meet your fellow Stewards, here to help you with your Station, and uncover the various critters inhabiting Nu Juno. There are figures hiding in the shadows and friends wandering down the streets, all here for you to meet!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Join up to 3 Friends exploring and unraveling the mysteries of Nu Juno together. Visit their station, invite them to yours or venture off on a journey together!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2812100/extras/uncover.png?t=1753238108\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2812100/extras/Portal.750.gif?t=1753238108\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore the procedurally generated world, filled with interesting encounters and situations. Unravel the grand mysteries of Nu Juno throughout the Campaign, then return to re-experience it with friends.\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">FEATURES:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Cooperative Drop In/Out Campaign</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">4 Player Online Multiplayer</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Procedurally Generated Maps with hand crafted landmarks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Character Customisation</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Building &amp; Gardening</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dynamic NPC's</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Vehicles, Mounts &amp; Pets</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Original Soundtrack</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">much more to come!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>DISCLAIMER:</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Stewards of Nu Juno is still early in development by a small independent team and is subject to change.\u00a0</i></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2812100?t=1753238108","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2812100/bc9721375e2f50e1bb4e0f43af7f406036db3162/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1753238108","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2812100/a37f050604ff783360b45729e6dd153aba9784af/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1753238108","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2812100/a37f050604ff783360b45729e6dd153aba9784af/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1753238108","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2812100/extras/welcome.bw.png?t=1753238108\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2812100/extras/LandscapeSwitch.750.gif?t=1753238108\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You are a Steward, here to take care of your very own Research Station in the mysterious lands of Nu Juno. Repair the stations crumbling facilitie