o. There are figures hiding in the shadows and friends wandering down the streets, all here for you to meet!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Join up to 3 Friends exploring and unraveling the mysteries of Nu Juno together. Visit their station, invite them to yours or venture off on a journey together!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2812100/extras/uncover.png?t=1753238108\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2812100/extras/Portal.750.gif?t=1753238108\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore the procedurally generated world, filled with interesting encounters and situations. Unravel the grand mysteries of Nu Juno throughout the Campaign, then return to re-experience it with friends.\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">FEATURES:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Cooperative Drop In/Out Campaign</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">4 Player Online Multiplayer</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Procedurally Generated Maps with hand crafted landmarks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Character Customisation</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Building &amp; Gardening</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dynamic NPC's</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Vehicles, Mounts &amp; Pets</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Original Soundtrack</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">much more to come!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>DISCLAIMER:</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Stewards of Nu Juno is still early in development by a small independent team and is subject to change.\u00a0</i></p>","developers":["lucki lamps"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"des